    {
      "Id": "f01d048c-1157-47b0-96dd-efca38b2c652",
      "Description": "There are additional operators for drawing meshes with specialized shaders.\nInstancing and field shaders are covered later."
    },
    {
      "Id": "2813f418-fa31-45f6-96a2-55aa1d6ae2f7",
      "Description": "This example uses a shader that produces a hatching-style look.\nIt is a good example of how drawing operators can define visual style directly."
